OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FWet and briefly windy
OL,6,Fconditions spread northeast, followed
OL,7,Fby a spell of heavy showers and
OL,8,Fthunderstorms. Central and northern
OL,9,FScotland remain largely dry with
OL,10,Fvariable cloud. Temperatures will be
OL,11,Fclose to average, with brighter
OL,12,Fintervals developing in places later
OL,13,Ftoday.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTonight:FRain clears from many central
OL,16,Fand southern areas, with a few showers
OL,17,Ffollowing. Rain persists across parts
OL,18,Fof northern England and eastern
OL,19,FScotland while persistent showers
OL,20,Freach Northern Ireland overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
