OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA bright start, though rain
OL,6,Fwill move northeastwards across
OL,7,FScotland during the morning. For most
OL,8,Fit will be a day of sunshine and
OL,9,Fshowers, these heavy with hail and
OL,10,Fthunder.
